  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial management support - review of multilateral - and old financial accounts - 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is assisting the HCE unit with timely review of the most urgent (aging and complex) financial accounts as well as  preparation of input to accounting notes to avoid an  increasing back log of a very large portfolio of approximately 250 accounts annually (including many complex multilateral accounts). The support will assist and improve flow in operations and increase the ability to perform timely financial monitoring and compliance.</narrative>
  </description>
